teamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/6d5f5521b965933e7c29ad29eae4e7b2.mp4?t=1787215891\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NEW RUN, NEW SHIP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on missions with varying objectives, starting gear, and rulesets. Each mission starts fresh and gives you a new opportunity to turn your ship into an overpowered vessel of destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/58168f2d17a22d2a070a17ba61cf223f.poster.avif?t=1787215891\" width=1170 height=506 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/58168f2d17a22d2a070a17ba61cf223f.webm?t=1787215891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/58168f2d17a22d2a070a17ba61cf223f.mp4?t=1787215891\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD YOUR BASE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completing missions earns you resources to build your own pirate base, unlocking new equipment, gameplay features, and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/50d9b35da8e927589c5dcb953bf55531.poster.avif?t=1787215891\" width=1170 height=574 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/50d9b35da8e927589c5dcb953bf55531.webm?t=1787215891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/50d9b35da8e927589c5dcb953bf55531.mp4?t=1787215891\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DESIGN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw your own unique pirate emblem to make your enemies quiver in fear! You can even import existing images from your computer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/5b4afba58da236fffd50650c4dfb4e09.poster.avif?t=1787215891\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/5b4afba58da236fffd50650c4dfb4e09.webm?t=1787215891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/5b4afba58da236fffd50650c4dfb4e09.mp4?t=1787215891\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REPLAYABILITY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a wide variety of objectives, game-changing rulesets, multiple difficulties, a massive arsenal of equipment, diverse upgrades, and powerful specialties, <i>Roguebound Pirates</i> is designed to be highly replayable!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/7ea0970300f9fbf6f4bdce243365e0b6.poster.avif?t=1787215891\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/7ea0970300f9fbf6f4bdce243365e0b6.webm?t=1787215891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/7ea0970300f9fbf6f4bdce243365e0b6.mp4?t=1787215891\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_